<title>CANADA: ICE HOCKEY-U.S. BEAT CANADA TO WIN WORLD CUP CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>ICE HOCKEY-U.S. BEAT CANADA TO WIN WORLD CUP CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the World Cup ice</p>
<p>hockey championship round on Saturday:</p>
<p> United States   5  Canada   2</p>
<p>(United States win best-of-three championship series 2-1)</p>
</text>
